    "body": "I think it is clear that devs are not following the clang-format config here even in new code, and I don't want to rub this in during review, nor do I want to see clang-format edit those when I use it locally.\r\n\r\nSo relax the config to allow those.\r\n\r\nReferences:\r\n\r\nhttps://clang.llvm.org/docs/ClangFormatStyleOptions.html#allowshortloopsonasingleline:\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\ngit grep --line-number --perl-regexp '^\\s*for \\([^)]+\\) [^{]+;$' ./src/ | wc -l\r\n-> 111\r\n```\r\n\r\nhttps://clang.llvm.org/docs/ClangFormatStyleOptions.html#alwaysbreaktemplatedeclarations:\r\n\r\n```\r\ngit grep --line-number --perl-regexp '^\\s*template\\s*<.*>\\s*(?:class|struct|[A-Za-z_])' | wc -l\r\n-> 162\r\n```",
    "labels": [
